* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
* Experimental source-terminated driver; NOT selected by the PHY library.
* Include analog/openlvds.spice for lvds_shift18_33 and lvds_cmfb definitions.
* Fixed 3.3/1.8 V supplies, 1.2 V reference and the existing 35 uA bias sink.
* The output current path is doubled without changing the D input stage.
* Source and far-end nominal 100 ohm loads divide the 7 mA steering current.
* Qualification requires DC/PVT, loaded-channel timing, and fresh GDS/RC tests.

.subckt openlvds_driver_core_source_terminated D OUTP OUTN VREF PB NB VDDIO VDDD VSS
XLS D DP DN NB VDDIO VDDD VSS lvds_shift18_33
* 200:1 PMOS mirror targets approximately 7 mA, including source termination.
XIT0 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT1 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT2 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT3 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT4 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT5 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT6 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT7 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT8 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT9 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XPL OUTP DN TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XPR OUTN DP TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XNL OUTP DN BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
XNR OUTN DP BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
XIB0 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB1 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB2 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB3 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB4 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB5 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB6 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB7 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB8 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB9 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
* A 0.96 feedback divider centers the output near 1.25 V using VREF=1.2 V.
XRCP OUTP CM VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=10.25
XRCN OUTN CM VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=10.25
XRCM0 CM CMS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=60
XRCM1 CMS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=60
* Local symmetric MIM loads bound switch-feedthrough common-mode ripple.
XCOUTP OUTP VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
XCOUTN OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
XCM CM VREF SINK NB VDDIO VSS lvds_cmfb
XIT10 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT11 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT12 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT13 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT14 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT15 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT16 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT17 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT18 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT19 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB10 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB11 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB12 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB13 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB14 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB15 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB16 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB17 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB18 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB19 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
* Parallel copies retain each output switch's original W/L and finger size.
XPL_PAR OUTP DN TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XPR_PAR OUTN DP TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XNL_PAR OUTP DN BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
XNR_PAR OUTN DP BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
* Twenty-two identical nominal 2.2 kohm units form approximately 100 ohm.
XTERM0 OUTP OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XTERM1 OUTP OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XTERM2 OUTP OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XTERM3 OUTP OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
